Subject: [PATCH] Adapt TTMath integer headers for Firebird

Backport the integer-only includes, public storage and trivial
constructors required by Firebird's INT128 backend to TTMath 0.9.3.

Upstream-Commit: https://github.com/FirebirdSQL/firebird/commit/861d536fc26542335f0fb84cdea825e891364057
